<section id="view-home" class="view">
  <div class="home-directory" id="homeDirectory">
    <section class="directory-hero" data-home-opening aria-labelledby="directoryHeroTitle">
      <div class="directory-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="assets/moonlit-almanac.webp" width="960" height="720" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
        <video class="yeonwoo-story-video" data-home-directory-video loop muted playsinline preload="none" data-video-src="assets/moonlit-almanac.mp4" poster="assets/moonlit-almanac.webp"></video>
      </div>
      <div class="directory-hero-copy">
        <h1 id="directoryHeroTitle">내 사주로 풀어보는<br>지금의 고민</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <button id="guidedDraftResume" class="guided-draft-resume" type="button" data-home-consultation hidden>
      <strong>작성 중인 상담 이어가기</strong>
      <span data-guided-draft-progress></span>
    </button>

    <div class="directory-recent" id="directoryRecent" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-home-consultation>
        <span><strong>지난 상담 이어가기</strong><small data-recent-question></small></span>
        <span data-recent-advisor></span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="directory-recent-dismiss" aria-label="지난 상담 이어가기 숨기기">
        <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <section class="directory-section directory-report-mode" aria-labelledby="directoryTopicsTitle">
      <div class="directory-mode-heading">
        <h2 id="directoryTopicsTitle" tabindex="-1">사주 리포트</h2>
        <p class="directory-report-note">첫 장 무료 · 1회 결제 · 담당 상담사와 채팅 3회 포함</p>
      </div>
      <div class="directory-characters" role="group" aria-label="고민별 사주 리포트">
        <a href="#topic-love" class="directory-character character-love" data-story-topic="love" data-consultation-topic="love" data-consultation-question="제 사주로 볼 때 연애와 관계에서 어떤 패턴이 반복되나요? 제가 먼저 바꿔볼 점을 알려주세요.">
          <span class="directory-portrait"><img src="assets/portrait-love.jpg" width="600" height="750" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
          <span class="directory-character-copy"><span>서화</span><strong>연애 · 관계</strong><small>연애 성향과 인연운이 깊어지는 달</small></span>
        </a>
        <a href="#topic-wealth" class="directory-character character-wealth" data-story-topic="wealth" data-consultation-topic="wealth" data-consultation-question="제 사주에서 돈을 벌 때의 강점과 돈을 관리할 때 주의할 점을 알려주세요.">
          <span class="directory-portrait"><img src="assets/portrait-wealth.jpg" width="600" height="750" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
          <span class="directory-character-copy"><span>도겸</span><strong>재물운</strong><small>돈이 들어오는 달과 지출을 살필 달</small></span>
        </a>
        <a href="#topic-reunion" class="directory-character" data-story-topic="reunion" data-consultation-topic="reunion" data-consultation-question="헤어진 사람에게 다시 연락할지 고민이에요. 제 사주에서 관계를 돌아보는 관점과 연락을 결정할 기준을 알려주세요.">
          <span class="directory-portrait"><img src="assets/topic-reunion-illustrated.jpg" width="600" height="750" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
          <span class="directory-character-copy"><span>이준</span><strong>재회운</strong><small>연락을 건넬 시기와 기다릴 시기</small></span>
        </a>
        <a href="#topic-career" class="directory-character character-career" data-story-topic="career" data-consultation-topic="career" data-consultation-question="이직을 고민 중이에요. 제 사주에서 어떤 업무 환경이 잘 맞는지 알려주세요.">
          <span class="directory-portrait"><img src="assets/portrait-career.jpg" width="600" height="750" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
          <span class="directory-character-copy"><span>무진</span><strong>직업 · 이직</strong><small>잘 맞는 일과 이직을 살필 달</small></span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="directory-features">
        <section class="directory-section" aria-labelledby="directoryNewyearTitle">
          <a class="directory-feature directory-feature-year" href="#newyear">
            <span class="directory-feature-copy"><strong id="directoryNewyearTitle">2027년 신년운세</strong><small>한 해 총평과 열두 달 풀이</small></span>
            <img src="assets/yeonwoo-moonlight.jpg" width="1122" height="1402" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
